            "background": "assets/generated/backgrounds/prologue_guardian_oath.webp",
            "mood": "fierce",
            "name": "나",
            "text": "숲을 태울 주문을 멈췄다. 불길은 길을 막지만, 우리 위치도 드러낸다.",
            "next": "c1_029",
            "i18n": {
                "en": {
                    "name": "Me",
                    "text": "I swallowed the spell that would burn the forest. A wall built from rage will one day cast its shadow over the child as well."
                },
                "ja": {
                    "name": "私",
                    "text": "私は森を焼く呪文を飲み込んだ。怒りで築いた壁は、いつか子どもにも影を落とす。"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "c1_028_name",
            "background": "assets/generated/backgrounds/prologue_guardian_oath.webp",
            "mood": "tender",
            "name": "나",
            "text": "유리카. 이름을 부르자 내 옷깃을 잡았다. 그걸로 충분했다.",
            "next": "c1_029",
            "i18n": {
                "en": {
                    "name": "Me",
                    "text": "Yurika. When I called that name, the child clutched my collar as if it were the first spell she learned before the world."
                },
                "ja": {
                    "name": "私",
                    "text": "ユリカ。その名を呼ぶと、子どもは私の襟を握りしめた。世界より先に覚えた呪文のように。"
                }
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "c1_029",
            "background": "assets/generated/backgrounds/prologue_guardian_oath.webp",
            "mood": "resolved",
            "actions": [
                {
                    "type": "cinematic_title",
                    "title": "오두막 경계",
